        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi eriŋa enyouno aboŋor, kotema atiar, “Koboŋo do neejai Gedalia okoku loka Akikam, okoku loka Sapan, loainaki ekabaka loko Babulon ayait ireria kere luka Yuda, kiboikin oreke otuŋa; arai bo ilosi kere neiwomit edolit alosit.” Kosodi ekapolon loka ikedarak ainakin ŋes inyamat, ka ainakinet, kolakak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
